/E (NTPC School of Business \(NSB\) conducted two batches of a Capacity Building Programme on Policy and Regulatory Aspects of Electricity Distribution for officials of Distribution Companies \(DISCOMs\) under Part-B of the Revamped Distribution Sector Scheme \(RDSS\), Ministry of Power, Government of India, during 9-11 Sept 2026 and 23-25 Sep 2026. The first batch of September 2026 trained 25 Participants from MGVCL, Gujarat, PGVCL, Gujarat, "WBSEDCL, West Bengal", JVVNL, Jodhpur, and the second batch included 28 trainees from MGVCL, Gujarat, PGVCL, Gujarat, WBSEDCL, West Bengal, JVVNL, Jodhpur and PSPCL Punjab.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
