<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 157 0 R
/E (The project was successfully secured through Open Competitive Bidding and is led by Dr Brijesh Bhatt. Under the project, NSB has been empanelled to conduct programmes in two key areas: Policy and Regulatory Aspects of Electricity Distribution and Financial Aspects of Electricity Distribution, aimed at strengthening the knowledge and capabilities of officials from Distribution Companies \(DISCOMs\) and State Electricity Regulatory Commissions \(SERCs\). The project envisages conducting 20 programmes, with an outreach target of approximately 500 officials from DISCOMs and SERCs. Through this project, NSB continues to contribute to professional development and capacity building in the power sector.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
