/P 158 0 R
/E (The programme covers key areas such as electricity laws and policies, the regulatory framework, tariff determination, power purchase management, distribution reforms, financial sustainability, loss reduction, consumer service delivery, and emerging challenges in the electricity sector. It also focuses on the implementation of government initiatives, regulatory compliance, operational efficiency, and the adoption of best practices for improving the performance of DISCOMs. Through expert-led sessions, interactive discussions, case-based learning, and experience sharing, participants gain practical insights into addressing sector-specific challenges and implementing effective solutions in their respective organizations. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
